{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人吳若希被無綫逐出《愛．回家之三代同糖》，劇中飾演「唐萬里」的她被公司「明升暗降」，「發配邊疆」吳旺達接管業務，歸期未定。</p><p>日前，有網民在社交平台發文，上載多張早前爆紅的靚仔「禮儀先生」吳敬浩的相片，豈料引起吳若希的注意，更風趣幽默地留言回</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:32:50.410178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T05:13:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.822139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.822139+00:00","content_hash":"27f6824ac9fb28190076c1befab40b0f5b14c82d7a4a9581bed5bc75e674721a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}